{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "Family Planz"}, "description": {"en-US": "The official Family Planz app repository. Shared calendar, tasks, and groceries that keep your family on one page. Same app as https://familyplanz.com."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/familyplanz.png", "sha256": "eabaa2dc6f0f1caa0b369681a135ce58123e5d65ab15f9094e5458506ef30676", "size": 37298}}, "address": "https://www.familyplanz.com/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1793712521000, "categories": {"Time": {"name": {"en-US": "Time"}}}}, "packages": {"com.familyplanz.app": {"metadata": {"added": 1793712516000, "categories": ["Time"], "changelog": "https://familyplanz.com/changelog", "issueTracker": "https://familyplanz.com/report-bug", "lastUpdated": 1793712517000, "license": "Apache-2.0", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/DevelopmentIntensified/FamilyCalendar", "webSite": "https://familyplanz.com/", "authorName": "Family Planz", "name": {"en-US": "Family Planz"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Shared calendar, tasks, and groceries that keep your family on one page."}, "description": {"en-US": "👪 Family Planz keeps your family on the same page — everything happening today, everything that needs doing, and everything to pick up on the way home. Mom and Dad plan the week; the kids always know what's due.\n\n<b>SHARED FAMILY CALENDAR</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Family events the whole household sees, with repeating schedules, times, and locations</li>\n<li>RSVP so everyone knows who is coming</li>\n<li>One calendar for the family: planning stays together, not split across apps</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>TASKS THAT ACTUALLY MOVE</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Priorities and due dates, so the important work is sorted first</li>\n<li>Hand a task to another family member — they accept or decline, and it lands on their list</li>\n<li>Completion history, so \"did that happen?\" has an answer</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>DAY DASHBOARD</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Today's events, the Top-3 Priorities for the family, and the Family Task Board on one screen — a good start to the day at breakfast.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>GROCERIES</b>\n<ul>\n<li>A check-off list sorted the way you shop — by store</li>\n<li>The app remembers which store you buy each item at and orders the list accordingly</li>\n<li>Checked-off items step aside until the next shopping run</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>QUICK ADD</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Type a sentence and the app fills the form for you — you always confirm before it saves</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>AND ON THE WEB</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Family Planz also runs in the browser — family data travels with the family account, on phones and computers alike.</li>\n</ul>\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.familyplanz.app/en-US/icon_260zSA_KB3sPcFjuM130oq69rOTZzHRMH668ufz7Zho=.png", "sha256": "dbad33480fca077b0f7058ee335df4a2aebdace4d9cc744c1faebcb9fcfb661a", "size": 18499}}, "preferredSigner": "5d944cd71fe83460a012d5065fc8a9bc47d752e75417a7b12b53c3ac163a8821"}, "versions": {"b897f870ff2fa4589973830cbac0087dd12f866d13467d0248e482837a0428f4": {"added": 1793712517000, "file": {"name": "/com.familyplanz.app_2002.apk", "sha256": "b897f870ff2fa4589973830cbac0087dd12f866d13467d0248e482837a0428f4", "size": 2777197}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "0.2.2", "versionCode": 2002, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["5d944cd71fe83460a012d5065fc8a9bc47d752e75417a7b12b53c3ac163a8821"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_EXACT_ALARM"}, {"name": "android.permission.SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "com.google.android.c2dm.permission.RECEIVE"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "com.familyplanz.app.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}, "5ed20ff13dca246560713156f9164594062